+    detail: >
+      Six findings on one mechanism, filed together because they share an owner
+      and a fix location (HomeProvenance, and HomeCloner's exemption branch).
+
+      MED-3, silent fail-open in front of a delete. HomeProvenance.read swallows
+      every IOException and RuntimeException and returns null. Null means "no
+      record", which after HIS-10's re-derivation change means "sanction
