++    - No command reports an artifact built when the path it names is unchanged.
++    - bootstrap-home.sh produces a usable ticket home from this project home, and HIS-4's worktree can
++      be created.
++    - A CLI genuinely provided by the system, outside every home, is still not reinstalled — the existing
++      escape hatch survives.
